    {
      "id": "d05e3a36b5",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h1",
      "text": "Google Meet vs. Zoom attendance reports (2026 comparison)"
    },
    {
      "id": "7433c97d71",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "p",
      "text": "Organizations switching from Zoom to Google Meet often hit an unexpected roadblock: while Zoom provides usage and attendance reports across all paid tiers, Google Meet gates native attendance tracking behind its most expensive enterprise and education tiers."
    },
    {
      "id": "5b8189149a",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "div",
      "text": "<strong>The Good News:</strong> You do not need to pay for Google's most expensive license. With the free <a href=\"https://workspace.google.com/marketplace/app/attendance_tracker/829771833968?utm_source=seo_zoom\">Attendance Tracker add-on</a>, you get full Zoom-style attendance reporting directly within Google Meet and Google Drive."
    },
    {
      "id": "9b79bed604",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h2",
      "text": "How Attendance Tracking Differs: Google Meet vs. Zoom"
    },
    {
      "id": "c8e55f25ef",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h3",
      "text": "1. Zoom Attendance Reports"
    },
    {
      "id": "1d2054bcf7",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "p",
      "text": "Zoom generates post-meeting reports under <em>Account Management &gt; Reports &gt; Usage Reports</em>. It provides participant names, join/leave times, and durations. However:"
    },
    {
      "id": "bbb6726b5b",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "Reports require navigating deep into the Zoom web dashboard after the meeting."
    },
    {
      "id": "1fc2fe363d",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "Data must be manually downloaded as raw CSV files."
    },
    {
      "id": "bd510db398",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "Live in-meeting participant rosters with duration tracking are not visible during the call."
    },
    {
      "id": "65e8a2657d",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h3",
      "text": "2. Native Google Meet (Built-In)"
    },
    {
      "id": "1266b0b74b",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "p",
      "text": "Google Meet has a built-in attendance feature, but it is heavily restricted:"
    },
    {
      "id": "3c50ec487a",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "Only available on <em>Google Workspace for Education Plus</em>, <em>Teaching &amp; Learning Upgrade</em>, and <em>Enterprise</em>."
    },
    {
      "id": "e3b67e7487",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "Requires a minimum of 5 attendees to trigger a report."
    },
    {
      "id": "5b547df924",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "Only emails the CSV report to the original meeting creator."
    },
    {
      "id": "4d57bd75b6",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "h3",
      "text": "3. Google Meet + Attendance Tracker Add-On (Best of Both Worlds)"
    },
    {
      "id": "6604f97cf0",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "p",
      "text": "Installing Attendance Tracker gives you the best features of both platforms:"
    },
    {
      "id": "5bbd7e628b",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "<strong>Works on All Google Accounts:</strong> Free on personal Gmail, Google Workspace Starter, Standard, and Education Fundamentals."
    },
    {
      "id": "8cd6fef18b",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "<strong>Real-Time In-Call Side Panel:</strong> View active participants, join times, and late-arrival flags live while the meeting is ongoing."
    },
    {
      "id": "c57af49449",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "<strong>Direct Google Drive Sync:</strong> Automatically creates tabbed, formatted Google Sheets without having to download or import CSVs."
    },
    {
      "id": "5900985638",
      "kind": "html",
      "key": "li",
      "text": "<strong>Multi-Meeting Trends:</strong> Automatically rolls up attendance streaks across recurring standups, sprint reviews, or class lectures."
    },
